ight: 133.333vw;\n      }\n\n      .document {\n        padding-right: 3.7vw;\n        padding-left: 3.7vw;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"toolbar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"toolbar-group\">\n        <span class=\"toolbar-icon square\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"toolbar-group\">\n        <span class=\"toolbar-icon lines\"></span>\n        <span class=\"toolbar-icon grid\"></span>\n        <span class=\"toolbar-icon camera\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"toolbar-group\">\n        <span class=\"toolbar-icon lines\"></span>\n        <span class=\"toolbar-icon circle\"></span>\n        <span class=\"toolbar-icon dots\"></span>\n        <span class=\"toolbar-icon pencil\"></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark\">[illegible]</div>\n\n    <article class=\"document\">\n      <h1 class=\"section-title\">Soalan</h1>\n\n      <div class=\"questions\">\n        <div class=\"question-number\">1.</div>\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n          Senaraikan cara-cara penentangan orang Melayu terhadap Malayan<br>\n          Union. [3m] (Perak)\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"question-number\">2.</div>\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n          <span class=\"highlight\">Jelaskan reaksi penduduk tempatan terhadap pembentukan Malayan<br>\n          Union.[6 m] (SBP)</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"question-number\">3.</div>\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n          Gambar memaparkan penentangan rakyat tempatan terhadap Malayan<br>\n          Union.\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"photo-row\">\n          <figure class=\"placeholder\" aria-label=\"Gambar penentangan rakyat tempatan\">\n            [Photo: penentangan rakyat tempatan]\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"prompt\">\n          Bagaimanakah mereka menzahirkan penentangan tersebut? [6m](Perak)\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section-title answers-title\">Jawapan</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"answers\">\n        <div class=\"answer-code fact\">F1</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text fact\">Membawa kes Malayan Union ke Mahkamah Tinggi England</div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code\">H1a</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text\">Persidangan Raja-raja Melayu di Istana Iskandariah Kuala Kangsar</div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code\">H1b</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text\">\n          Sultan Perak, Sultan Kedah dan Sultan Johor akan berangkat ke England<br>\n          sekiranya kehadiran mereka diperlukan di mahkamah tersebut.\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code fact\">F2</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text fact\">Menghantar surat bantahan ke London</div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code\">H2a</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text\">\n          Sultan Kedah, Perak dan Johor mengutus surat bantahan kepada<br>\n          Setiausaha Tanah Jajahan British, George Henry Hall\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code\">H2b</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text\">\n          Tuanku Syed Putra Jamalullail mengirim telegram kepada kerajaan British<br>\n          di London.\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code fact\">F3</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text fact\">Menyokong Kongres Melayu</div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code\">H3</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text\">\n          Sultan Hisamuddin Alam Shah ibni Almarhum Sultan Alauddin Sulaiman<br>\n          Shah menderma sebanyak $15 ribu kepada Persatuan Melayu Selangor.\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code fact\">F4</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text fact\">Permaisuri Perak memimpin Gerakan menentang Malayan Union</div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code\">H4</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text\">\n          Tuanku Permaisuri Perak, Raja Perempuan Kelsom mengetuai barisan<br>\n          hadapan perarakan.\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code fact\">F5</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text fact\">Memulau upacara pelantikan Gabenor Malayan Union</div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code\">H5</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text\">\n          Dato' Onn Jaafar mempersembahkan resolusi Kongres Melayu, memohon<br>\n          Raja-raja Melayu supaya bersama-sama dengan rakyat memboikot<br>\n          upacara pelantikan Gabenor Malayan Union.\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code fact\">F6</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text fact\">Menggunakan akhbar</div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code\">H6a</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text\">menyeru orang Melayu mengadakan perhimpunan besar besaran.</div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code\">H6b</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text\">sentiasa melaporkan perkembangan berita penentangan orang Melayu.</div>\n\n        <div class=\"answer-code\">C6</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-text\">Utusan Melayu, Majlis, Warta Negara</div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <div class=\"home-indicator\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
